OL,3,AFlights grounded at major US airports
OL,4,Aafter cable cut by construction workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights have been grounded at major US
OL,7,Fairports after construction crews cut a
OL,8,Fcable needed for air traffic control, a
OL,9,Ftop aviation official says
OL,11,FFederal Aviation Administration
OL,12,Fofficial Bryan Bedford says the issue
OL,13,Fis related to a system that guides
OL,14,Fplanes during take-off and landing
OL,16,FHe says a crucial cable was damaged by
OL,17,Fconstruction crews in New Jersey, and
OL,18,Fit will take 13 hours to repair:
OL,19,F"Somebody dug it up"
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
