OL,3,AFlights grounded at major US airports
OL,4,Aafter cable cut by construction workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FGround stops have been ordered in New
OL,7,FYork City, Boston and Philadelphia, the
OL,8,FFAA says
OL,10,FDelays are spreading after scores of
OL,11,Fflights were left stranded on runways
OL,12,Fon Monday morning. Boston Logan
OL,13,FInternational Airport has warned
OL,14,Ftravellers to expect disruption
